SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE
=====================

The MIT Licence below covers only the work of this project's authors: the corpus
aggregation and deduplication logic, the scope and fold decisions, all code under
`code/`, the analysis and figure scripts, the verification scripts, and the derived
results under `results/`, `predictions/`, `splits/` and `robustness/`.

It does NOT cover the third-party datasets redistributed under `sources/`. Those files
are the work of their original authors and remain under their own terms, which are
recorded in `sources/SOURCES.md`. Nothing in this licence grants any right in them.

`corpus/nfr_corpus.csv` contains requirement text derived from those third-party
datasets. The aggregation, labelling decisions and identifiers are ours and fall under
this licence; the underlying requirement text does not.

